  "abstract_summary": "Abstract Small object detection in unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) imagery is severely hindered by low spatial resolution, faint boundaries, drastic scale variations, and complex background interference. To address these vulnerabilities, we propose YOLO-MAG, an edge-preserving architecture built upon YOLO11 for aerial...",
